    },
    {
      "x": 13720,
      "y": 677.067,
      "id": "signal_buttons",
      "text": "Three bright buttons in a tin. He chose the blue one and put the others back."
    },
    {
      "x": 15740,
      "y": 605.037,
      "id": "station_roots",
      "text": "A root had found a crack between the tiles. It was growing toward the light."
